<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ total ord time earnings up 1.1 pct in Feb qtr.</title>
<headline>NZ total ord time earnings up 1.1 pct in Feb qtr.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following information from the February quarterly employment survey was released by Statistics New Zealand on Thursday:</p>
<p>Ordinary time average hourly earnings, percentage change from same period of previous quarter:  </p>
<p>		    Feb 1997 qtr    Nov 1996 qtr    Feb 1996 qtr</p>
<p>Private sector     1.1 pct	    0.6 pct	  1.3 pct </p>
<p>Public sector	0.8 pct	    1.7 pct	  0.2 pct </p>
<p>Total		  1.1 pct	    0.9 pct	  1.0 pct</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Ordinary time average hourly earnings, change from same period of previous year: Total Feb 1997 yr Nov 1996 yr Feb 1996 yr NZ$ $16.41 $16.23 $15.80 Pct change 3.9 3.7 3.2</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
</text>
